==Miscellaneous==
*Added [[Cat Combo]] feature.
*Added 1 new Trait: '''[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]''' (エイリアン)
*Added 4 new Abilities:
**'''[[Weaken]]''' (攻撃力ダウン): Units with this ability have a chance to reduce the damage of their foes to a certain percentage for a set amount of time. [[Fruit Treasures]] increase duration for Cats by 20%.
**'''[[Metal]]''' (メタル): Cats with this ability take 1 damage from all non-[[Critical]] or [[Toxic]] attacks. Works identically to the Metal trait.
**'''[[Strengthen]]''' (攻撃力アップ): When a unit with this ability falls below a set percentage of health, they receive a percentage-based damage buff.
**'''[[Survive]]''' (生き残る): If a unit with this ability would die, they get knocked back and survive on 1 health. This only works once per unit.
*[[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Pogo Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Mer-Cat]] and [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] gain Survive.
*[[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]], [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] gain Weaken.
*[[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]], [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]] and [[Takeda Shingen (Uber Rare Cat)|Takeda Shingen]] now target Alien.
*[[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Maeda Keiji]] gains Strengthen.
*[[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]] gains Massive damage to Aliens.
*[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] gains Strong against Aliens.

